Layer 3 — This work / 本作
--------------------------
HALOFLUX for Hermes — a Hermes Agent dashboard plugin adaptation
of HALOFLUX · AI LINK.

Changes made in this layer / 本层改动面：
- The data layer was replaced: telemetry is now read from Hermes
  Agent's own state.db by a dashboard plugin backend
  (dashboard/plugin_api.py), instead of the original local service.
- The frontend now polls a same-origin plugin endpoint
  (/api/plugins/haloflux/stats) behind the dashboard login.
- Close-up composition parameters are applied by default
  (camera zoom / ring width tuning for readability).

数据层改为由 dashboard 插件后端读取 Hermes Agent 自身的 state.db；
前端改走同源插件接口（经 dashboard 登录鉴权）；默认启用特写构图
参数（相机缩放 / 环带宽度，提升可读性）。

